This repository ports Saints Reborn by Whompay to ARM64 Linux.
Saints Reborn: https://github.com/whompay/SaintsReborn
Copyright 2026 Whompay, Apache License 2.0.
The patches in patches/ change Saints Reborn and its patch of the ReXGlue SDK;
the scripts download both from their own repositories at build time.

ReXGlue SDK: https://github.com/rexglue/rexglue-sdk
Copyright (c) 2026, Tom Clay, with portions derived from the Xenia project
(Copyright (c) 2022, Ben Vanik and Xenia project contributors).

The shader math and shared memory texel buffer changes in patches/sdk (0006,
0007) are ported from shiftglue-sdk, Pinyon Shift's fork of the ReXGlue SDK:
https://github.com/arcanite24/shiftglue-sdk, under the same license as the
ReXGlue SDK.

The Steam artwork is drawn on the player's machine from Saints Reborn's own
logo and icon (core/SaintsRebornLogo/logo.png, project/res/SaintsReborn.ico),
read with stb_image (public domain, from the SDK's thirdparty folder); none of
it is stored here.

The toolchain setup follows pinyon-shift-arm64
(https://github.com/Ken5998/pinyon-shift-arm64) and uses the ARM64 sysroot it
publishes.

